Scan your own repos with DeepSec

Usage: wally deepsec [OPTIONS] [args...]

Arguments:
  args                        DeepSec's own command and options; with none, init

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -m, --model TEXT            A model from your account (default: your default
                              model)

Examples:
  # Start a scan on a repo you are authorised to test (runs init)
  wally deepsec -- init . ./my-repo

  # Choose the model
  wally deepsec -m glm-5.3-flash -- process

  # Other DeepSec commands pass through
  wally deepsec -- status
